nated papers have remained stable whereas the prices of those denominated in euros have risen following the developments on the foreign markets," Raiffeisenbank said in its daily notice.  \par \par \uc2 Live bond trade on <0#HRTSY=ZA>.  \par \par \uc2 Live corporate bond trade on <0#HRCORP=ZA>.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-CROATIA-MONEY|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020061027e2ar00135\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
