y rises -- and towards 7.10 or even beyond in the coming years.  \par \par \uc2 In four \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  this year to tame the kuna gains the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has bought 233.6 million euros from commercial banks altogether.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-CROATIA-\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2 |LANGEN|ABN|M|D  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020060509e25900120\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
