recently told Reuters steady appreciation pressures were very likely as the country nears EU membership.  \par \par \uc2 They said the kuna might firm to as much as 7.25 per euro this summer and possibly towards 7.10 or even beyond in the coming years.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-CROATIA-\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020060216e22g0011s\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
